# Claude Code tooling rewrites these with CRLF on Windows/WSL, which git reports
# as a full-file rewrite: 142 skill files showed as modified with zero content
# change. Normalising keeps that churn out of every future diff.
#
# Scoped to .claude/ deliberately. A repo-wide rule would also renormalise ~113
# Unity files that are legitimately stored with CRLF, which is a much larger and
# unrelated change.
.claude/** text=auto eol=lf
